+**Files:** Query `Accounts/GetAccountQuery.cs`, `GetAccountHandler.cs`, output/status map; WebApi `AccountController.cs`, `Startup.cs`; Query tests and WebApi account-read HTTP tests; OpenAPI/README/operational docs.
